/// these extension methods, which provide ergonomic async functions such as
/// `write_all` and `flush`.
///
/// [`std::io::Write`]: std::io::Write
/// [`Write::write`]: std::io::Write::write()
/// [`poll_write`]: AsyncWrite::poll_write()
